      "value": "This was driving me mad while I was recording clips with ShareX. \nMy bind for screen capture is shift+prtsc, and once ShareX took focus away for a second, VRChat would think I continued holding shift which would throw me into Safe Mode when opening the menu.\nI re-recorded my clips quite a few times before I figured out why it was throwing me into Safe Mode.",
